      "side": 1,
      "message": "It feels like waiting 5 min for a PR to be merges is a bit too much. In the current `mergePull` implementation we have a sleep of 5s with five attempts.\n\nThe problem I see here is that a pending merge (and I don\u0027t have a good grasp what could be the reason for that; maybe missing requirements / reviews?) could block pipeline processing during that time and with that the whole scheduler.",
      "revId": "2eac55882a566d7b6b8dc34854af98e215da429b",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
